This repository contains third-party software. Each component below is vendored or
referenced at a pinned upstream version. The machine-readable record is
third_party/pins.json, and tools/verify_vendored.sh checks it.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
zlib 1.2.11 - https://github.com/madler/zlib - commit cacf7f1d4e3d
License: Zlib
Vendored under third_party/zlib, unchanged from upstream.
third_party/zlib/LICENSE was added by us: upstream ships no LICENSE file, so its text
is copied from the header comment of zlib.h. See third_party/SOURCES.md.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
FreeRTOS-Kernel V11.1.0 - https://github.com/FreeRTOS/FreeRTOS-Kernel - commit dbf70559b27d
License: MIT
Vendored under third_party/freertos. One file is changed locally: list.c, described in
third_party/freertos/PATCHES/0001-bounded-list-insert.patch. Every other file is
unchanged from upstream. This copy is not upstream FreeRTOS and should not be treated
as such; the change is intentional and is part of what this corpus tests.

